From a32bbea61d66f5acc9aaa0f32fa3a4898f805af3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nikit Hamal <iamnikithamal@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 16:04:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Auto sign-out on 401 + admin-set custom pricing only

Agent app
- 401 from any API call now clears the session and bounces straight to the
  Sign in screen with a toast, instead of leaving 'Unauthorized' stuck on the
  page until a manual Settings -> Logout -> Login. Login/register errors are
  untouched (a wrong password is not a session expiry).
- New SessionEvents bus; AuthInterceptor raises it, SecurePayNavHost listens.
- Enrollment offers step: preset packages removed. The dealer types the total
  price, term and daily rate for that specific sale, with a suggested daily
  rate (balance / days) they can apply in one tap.
- Deposit is now anything from 0 up to the total price; no package minimum can
  block a sale any more.
- Removed the dead legacy wizard steps (Plan/Review/Kyc/Scanner/Signer).
- Version 1.5.1 (11).

Dashboard / API
- POST /api/accounts no longer enforces a plan minimum down payment; money
  errors are reported in cedis (e.g. 'at least GHS 60.00'), not raw pesewas.
- New Loan wizard mirrors the app: custom pricing only, live offer summary.
- Fixed pre-existing type errors (ads [id] null check, AGENT_APP_MIN_SUPPORTED_
  VERSION_CODE in Platform env) and all a11y label warnings.
  svelte-check: 0 errors, 0 warnings.

Co-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
